---
layout: layout.njk
title: Mojibake – infrastructure for the agent era
description: Mojibake is the company behind Pipeworx, an open MCP gateway that grounds AI agents in live data from hundreds of real sources.
---

<section class="hero">
  <p class="hero-eyebrow">Mojibake · the company behind Pipeworx</p>
  <h1 class="hero-title">The data layer for AI&nbsp;agents.</h1>
  <p class="hero-subtitle">We build Pipeworx — an open gateway that grounds AI agents in live data from thousands of real tools. No keys, no setup.</p>
  <div class="hero-cta">
    <a href="https://pipeworx.io" class="cta-button" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Explore Pipeworx&nbsp;↗</a>
    <a href="/#contact" class="cta-button secondary">Get in touch</a>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="content-section dark">
  <div class="container">
    <h2 class="section-title">Agents are only as good as their data.</h2>
    <p class="large-text">Language models guess when they can't look things up. Ask one for a company's latest filing, a drug label, or yesterday's weather, and you'll get something fluent — and possibly wrong.</p>
    <p class="large-text">Pipeworx fixes that with a single connection: an open MCP gateway that routes any agent to live, verifiable data — SEC filings, economic indicators, government records, prediction markets, weather, and hundreds more sources.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="content-section">
  <div class="container">
    <h2 class="section-title">One gateway. Thousands of live tools.</h2>
    <p class="large-text">Agents connect once and discover tools on demand. It works out of the box with Claude, ChatGPT, Cursor, Gemini, and anything else that speaks MCP — with a free tier and no signup required.</p>
    <p class="large-text"><a href="https://pipeworx.io" class="text-link" target="_blank" rel="noopener">pipeworx.io&nbsp;↗</a></p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="content-section dark">
  <div class="container">
    <h3 class="mission-subtitle">Built differently</h3>
    <h2 class="section-title">A solo founder running an AI-agent fleet.</h2>
    <p class="large-text">Mojibake was founded by Bruce Gutman — twenty-five years in software across developer relations, documentation, and product, and a repeat founder. Pipeworx is built and operated by one person directing a fleet of AI agents: the same kind of agentic software the product exists to serve.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="apps-strip">
  <div class="container centered">
    <h3 class="mission-subtitle">Also from Mojibake</h3>
    <h2 class="section-title">Consumer apps from our studio.</h2>
  </div>
  <div class="apps-grid">
    {% for app in apps %}
    <a href="/apps/{{ app.slug }}/" class="app-card">
      <h3>{{ app.name }}</h3>
      <p>{{ app.tagline }}</p>
    </a>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
</section>

<section id="contact" class="content-section contact-section dark">
  <div class="container">
    <h2 class="section-title centered">Get in touch</h2>
    <form class="contact-form" action="{{ site.contact_form_endpoint }}" method="POST">
      <div class="form-group">
        <input type="text" name="name" placeholder="Your name" required>
      </div>
      <div class="form-group">
        <input type="email" name="email" placeholder="Your email" required>
      </div>
      <div class="form-group">
        <textarea name="message" placeholder="Your message" rows="6" required></textarea>
      </div>
      <button type="submit" class="submit-button">Send Message</button>
    </form>
  </div>
</section>
